9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/f091cc66b4d6bb7280d7f2d39296fafa.mp4?t=1791993123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Producing lots of crops and data will allow you to upgrade your base and buy new tools!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your base and equipment</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/509813d0e6781d265438d23e428acf73.poster.avif?t=1791993123\" width=596 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/509813d0e6781d265438d23e428acf73.webm?t=1791993123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/509813d0e6781d265438d23e428acf73.mp4?t=1791993123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/6604dad75e6c2a8458dc3c62fe534e0d.poster.avif?t=1791993123\" width=596 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/6604dad75e6c2a8458dc3c62fe534e0d.webm?t=1791993123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/6604dad75e6c2a8458dc3c62fe534e0d.mp4?t=1791993123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Apply new paint jobs and upgrades to your structures and your sled!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploring</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/325210/extras/2fc0aa2056aefc836057f3b60c1387c5.poster.avif?t=1791993123\" width=594 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass